  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>}</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>A</mi></math> : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>|</mo></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"\"><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> be a relation on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>. Then the minimum number of elements, that must be added to the relation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> so that it becomes reflexive and symmetric, is",
    "image": null
  },
