  "correctValue": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>}</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>A</mi></math> : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>|</mo></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"\"><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> be a relation on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>,</p><p>So, the relation is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>}</mo></math></p><p>Now, relation to be reflexive <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> also should be added in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>.</p><p>Now relation to be symmetric if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math> also should be added in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math></p><p>Hence, minimum number of elements to be added to<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
